{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.haruki.third",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "见习期的晚上，她一个人还在练",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.haruki.third",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.haruki.third",
    "idolId": "haruki",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "text": "练习室的灯还亮着。她一个人在过同一段动作。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "……啊，制作人先生。这么晚了，怎么了？",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "看你还没回去。……今天训练师说了什么？",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "「郁田さん，还在试用期吧」",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "「要是想当偶像，可不是这种程度哦」──这样说",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……这样啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "还有美术学校的老师也说过，有人从早上睁眼到睡觉，连梦里都在画画",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "说我们要跟那样的人竞争",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "……我能看见的东西太多了",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "很多东西我都喜欢，都想去碰一碰",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "可是这样什么都伸手去够，感觉反而把什么推远了……",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……我觉得，正是那些\"都想试试\"，才做出了现在的你。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──哪一个都不用放弃，只要你还在追。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "而且，认真撞过每一件事的你，在哪一行都能发光。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "──────……呵呵。那，偶像也算吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯。我觉得算。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（她好像松了口气，又好像在忍着什么）",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "制作人先生。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "我……真的可以当偶像吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "不是试试看的那种。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这件事，得你自己决定。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "……嗯。"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
